{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"一、九年，春，紀季姜歸于京師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"其辭成矣，則其稱紀季姜何？自我言，紀父母之於子，雖為天王后，猶曰吾季姜。京師者何？天子之居也。京者何？大也。師者何？眾也。天子之居，必以眾大之辭言之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"四、冬，曹伯使其世子射姑來朝。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_20_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_20","textTraditional":"諸侯來曰朝，此世子也，其言朝何？春秋有譏父老子代從政者，則未知其在齊與？曹與？","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}